{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标（PR-AUC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/practice/evaluation-metrics","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"评估指标-pr-auc\">评估指标（PR-AUC）</h1><p>回到<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">挑战篇</a>那个例子：一百万笔交易里一千笔欺诈，把所有交易判为正常就有 99.9% 的准确率。这个数字漂亮得令人羞耻，它精确地说明了为什么异常检测不能用准确率来评估。这一篇是全 hub 评估的主讲处——它推导在极端不平衡下哪些指标可信、为什么精确率—召回率曲线下面积（PR-AUC）比广受欢迎的 ROC-AUC 更值得相信，以及怎么用一个数字公平地比较两个检测器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-混淆矩阵与基础指标\">核心概念：混淆矩阵与基础指标</h2><p>一切评估始于把判定结果归入四个格子。约定异常为正类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>预测异常</th>\n<th>预测正常</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真实异常</td>\n<td>TP（真正例）</td>\n<td>FN（漏报）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实正常</td>\n<td>FP（误报）</td>\n<td>TN（真负例）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由此定义异常检测真正关心的两个指标。精确率回答&quot;我报的警里有多少是真的&quot;:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>召回率回答&quot;真异常里我抓到了多少&quot;:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recall} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意准确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mtext>总数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{TP+TN}{\\text{总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 完全没出现——因为 TN 在不平衡下是个天文数字，会把任何指标稀释成无意义的接近 1。精确率和召回率之所以有用，正是因为它们都不含 TN。二者通常此消彼长：调低阈值多报警，召回率升但精确率降；反之亦然。F1 分数取二者的调和平均把它们合成一个数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Recall</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Recall</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1 = \\frac{2 \\cdot \\text{Precision} \\cdot \\text{Recall}}{\\text{Precision} + \\text{Recall}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但 F1 依赖一个特定阈值，而<a href=\"../foundations/what-is-anomaly-detection\">基础篇</a>强调过，好的评估应当衡量分数排序质量、与阈值无关。这就引出了曲线下面积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roc-auc-的陷阱\">ROC-AUC 的陷阱</h2><p>ROC 曲线画的是不同阈值下真正例率（TPR=召回率）对假正例率（FPR）的轨迹，ROC-AUC 是其下面积，等价于&quot;随机取一个异常和一个正常，异常分数更高的概率&quot;。它流行、直观、与阈值无关，看起来完美。</p>\n<p>但它在极端不平衡下有一个致命陷阱：FPR 的分母是全部正常样本，数量巨大，导致即使误报的绝对数量很多，FPR 仍然很小，ROC 曲线看上去依然漂亮。换句话说，ROC-AUC 会系统性地高估检测器在不平衡数据上的实用价值。一个把成千上万正常样本误报的检测器，ROC-AUC 可能还有 0.95，但运营人员被海量误报淹没，实际根本不可用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[评估一个检测器] --&gt; B{数据是否极端不平衡?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否 接近平衡| C[ROC-AUC 可用]&#10;    B --&gt;|是 异常稀少| D[ROC-AUC 会虚高]&#10;    D --&gt; E[改用 PR-AUC]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Precision 含 FP 不含 TN]&#10;    F --&gt; G[对误报敏感 更贴近实际可用性]&#10;    C --&gt; H[最终仍建议报告 PR-AUC]\">graph TD\n    A[评估一个检测器] --&gt; B{数据是否极端不平衡?}\n    B --&gt;|否 接近平衡| C[ROC-AUC 可用]\n    B --&gt;|是 异常稀少| D[ROC-AUC 会虚高]\n    D --&gt; E[改用 PR-AUC]\n    E --&gt; F[Precision 含 FP 不含 TN]\n    F --&gt; G[对误报敏感 更贴近实际可用性]\n    C --&gt; H[最终仍建议报告 PR-AUC]</pre><h2 id=\"pr-auc-不平衡下的金标准\">PR-AUC：不平衡下的金标准</h2><p>精确率—召回率曲线画的是不同阈值下精确率对召回率的轨迹，PR-AUC（也叫平均精确率 AP）是其下面积。它和 ROC-AUC 的关键差异在于：精确率的分母是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP+FP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，包含误报数 FP——这意味着 PR-AUC 对误报极其敏感。在异常稀少时，哪怕多出一些误报，精确率就会明显下跌，PR-AUC 随之下降，从而诚实地反映检测器是否真的可用。</p>\n<p>正因如此，机器学习社区在不平衡问题上的共识是：用 PR-AUC / AUPRC 而非准确率或 ROC-AUC。PR-AUC 还有一个有用的参照点——随机检测器的 PR-AUC 等于数据中异常的比例（基线），所以异常占 0.1% 时，PR-AUC=0.1 就已是随机水平的 100 倍。下表汇总三个核心曲线指标的取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>与阈值无关</th>\n<th>不平衡下可信</th>\n<th>随机基线</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准确率</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>多数类占比</td>\n<td>几乎不用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROC-AUC</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（虚高）</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>平衡数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR-AUC</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>异常占比</td>\n<td>不平衡（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时序与范围场景的扩展\">时序与范围场景的扩展</h2><p>当数据是时间序列、异常以&quot;区间&quot;而非&quot;孤立点&quot;出现时，逐点的 PR-AUC 还不够，因为它没考虑&quot;检出区间的边缘也算部分正确&quot;。<a href=\"../ml-deep-methods/time-series-anomaly\">时间序列篇</a>详细讨论过这层复杂度，这里只补全评估视角：TSB-AD benchmark 选定 VUS-PR 作为主指标，它对不同缓冲长度计算 Range-AUC 再积成曲面，既无参数也与阈值无关，是 PR-AUC 在时序上的范围感知推广。同时务必避开点调整指标——它会把分数灾难性抬高，是时序评估里最大的坑。</p>\n<p>PyOD 这类库默认就用 ROC-AUC 和&quot;前 n 名精确率&quot;报告 benchmark，但在自己的不平衡业务数据上，应当坚持以 PR-AUC 为主指标做选型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"没有标签时怎么评估\">没有标签时怎么评估</h2><p>最后回到<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">挑战篇</a>提出的鸡生蛋困境：无监督场景没有标签，上面所有指标都算不出来。实践中的破局手段一脉相承——标注一个小的验证集（哪怕几百条）专门用于算 PR-AUC 和调阈；注入合成异常作为代理金标准；以及通过人工反馈闭环逐步积累标签。这些标签积累起来后，不仅能评估，还能为下一篇<a href=\"thresholding-deployment\">阈值选择</a>提供调阈依据——评估和定阈本就是同一批标签的两种用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>准确率在极端不平衡下毫无意义（全判正常就有 99.9%），异常检测的核心指标是不含 TN 的精确率与召回率。</li>\n<li>ROC-AUC 虽与阈值无关，但其 FPR 分母过大，在异常稀少时会系统性虚高，掩盖海量误报，不可作为不平衡场景的主指标。</li>\n<li>PR-AUC 的精确率分母含误报数 FP，对误报敏感，能诚实反映可用性，是不平衡问题的金标准；其随机基线等于异常占比。</li>\n<li>时序区间异常用 VUS-PR 作范围感知推广并避开点调整；无标签时靠小验证集、合成异常、反馈闭环获取评估与调阈所需的标签。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评估指标（PR-AUC）","id":"评估指标-pr-auc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：混淆矩阵与基础指标","id":"核心概念-混淆矩阵与基础指标"},{"level":2,"text":"ROC-AUC 的陷阱","id":"roc-auc-的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"PR-AUC：不平衡下的金标准","id":"pr-auc-不平衡下的金标准"},{"level":2,"text":"时序与范围场景的扩展","id":"时序与范围场景的扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"没有标签时怎么评估","id":"没有标签时怎么评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时间序列异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/ml-deep-methods/time-series-anomaly"},"next":{"title":"阈值选择与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/practice/thresholding-deployment"}}